  "notable_quotes": [
    "IISERP-MOF28 was synthesized as a 3D Zn-aminotriazolato-acetato-hydroxide framework using a DMF + water solvothermal system.",
    "The MOF adsorbs 3.1 mmol g−1 CO2 at 1 bar, 298 K and 2.2 mmol g−1 at 0.15 bar, 25 °C, relevant to post-combustion flue gas.",
    "IISERP-MOF28 is thermally stable up to 260 °C and permanently porous, showing a type I N2 isotherm and BET area of 497 m2 g−1."
